      "content": "Wait, you're saying I should basically ignore one side of the debate for my exam? That feels a bit extreme. If I'm writing a paper on the merits of the debate, wouldn't I need to understand the actual logic behind the \"evolving standards\" argument? Like, what is the scholarly justification for why the Constitution *should* be interpreted that way, rather than just calling it \"subjective\"?",
